  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> are square matrices of order <math><mn>3</mn></math> such that <math><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>B</mi></math><br />Taking determinant on both sides, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi></math><br />Taking determinant on both sides, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mn>27</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>"
  }
